; FBX 7.4.0 project file
; Hand-written test file: a 3-bone arm (Shoulder > Elbow > Wrist > WristEnd), 3 frames at 30 fps.
; The Elbow has a joint orient (PreRotation 0,0,90), so its rest turn is not zero and the Wrist offset is in its
; turned frame. World places, worked out by hand (FBX default order XYZ = Rz*Ry*Rx):
;   frame 0: elbow (10,0,0)  wrist (20,0,0)   end (25,0,0)
;   frame 1: shoulder Z 90, elbow Z 90:        elbow (0,10,0)   wrist (-10,10,0)  end (-15,10,0)
;   frame 2: shoulder moved (1,2,3), Y 90 Z 90: elbow (1,2,-7)   wrist (1,2,-17)   end (1,2,-22)
FBXHeaderExtension:  {
	FBXHeaderVersion: 1003
	FBXVersion: 7400
}
